  "date": "2015-02",
  "title": "Congressi Stefano Franscini Extends Deadline",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Conferences 2016 Congressi Stefano Franscini",
      "text": "The Congressi Stefano Franscini (CSF), the meeting platform of the Swiss Federal Institute of Technology of Zurich (ETH Zurich), has extended the deadline for submission of Proposals for obtaining a subsidy from the CSF for conferences in 2016 from 15 January 2015 to 8 February 2015."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Conferences 2016 Congressi Stefano Franscini",
      "text": "The Congressi Stefano Franscini (CSF) gives the possibility to organize research conferences at Monte Verità, a hilltop over Ascona and Lake Maggiore.\n\nAll researchers and university professors working in Switzerland are invited to submit their proposal for a meeting to be held in 2016; international collaborations are welcome. The applications will be evaluated by an interdisciplinary scientific board."
    },
    {
      "heading": "ETH Winter Schools @Monte Verità 2015/2016",
      "text": "The Congressi Stefano Franscini (CSF) gives ETH Zurich researchers or professors the possibility to organize a Winter School for doctoral students at Monte Verità, a hilltop over Ascona and Lake Maggiore.\n\nThe aim is to provide participants with in depth knowledge on a specific research topic and insight into its leading edge research. The proposals will be evaluated by the Scientific Board of the CSF."
    }
  ],
